# Browser-automation artefacts. Research agents drive a real browser and leave
# screenshots and accessibility snapshots in the working directory; `git add -A`
# swept twenty-four of them in, including reference shots of other people's
# websites. Project figures live in analysis/figures/ and are not matched here.
/*.png
/*.yml
/snap-*.md

